# issue: none
# notes: query-fuzz repro `read-named-search-calls-itself` (query-fuzz/README.md); the edition-2 text, expectations blessed from EDITION-2

--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Doc { title: String @index }

--- seed
{"type":"Doc","id":"d1","data":{"title":"dog"}}

--- query
query search() {
  match {
    $d: Doc
    search($d.title, "dog")
  }
  return { $d.title }
}

--- expect unordered
{"d.title": "dog"}

--- expect shape
d.title: String
